// Chorus  [audioEffect] — a 30 ms tap swept by a sine and mixed under the dry, one knob for rate and depth
// at once. The blindtest's "chorus", with z0's own numbers: 0.2–5 Hz, up to 20 ms of sweep, 70/30.
// Its DSP is described in jsdsp.ts beside this file, not compiled into the engine.
plugin({ type: "jsdsp", name: "Chorus" })
params({ Amount: 0 })
// One knob moves the rate (0.2 to 5 Hz) and the depth (0 to 20 ms) together, which is what makes a single number enough. At 0 the tap stands still at 30 ms and the result is a fixed comb, not silence.
